    "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
    "points": [
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p001",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "The series is designed to teach large language models from the basics without assuming prior knowledge, focusing on the nuts and bolts of every concept.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@54",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@57",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@59",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@61",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@64"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p002",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "Many people learning about large language models make the mistake of jumping directly to applications and running notebooks or code without understanding how the models actually work.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@88",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@89",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@91",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@94",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@96",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@101"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p003",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "Building a large language model completely from scratch would make a learner feel much more confident about the subject.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@119",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@122",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@127",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@130"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p004",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "The playlist aims to comprehensively show how to build a large language model from scratch, and by the end the learner will have built one successfully by themselves.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@135",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@137",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@139",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@142",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@148",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@155",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@157"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p005",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "After understanding how to build a large language model from scratch, later application-focused parts will seem much easier.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@161",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@163",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@164",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@166",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@169"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p006",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 1,
        "text": "All videos in the series and the detailed lecture notes will be available for free.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@181",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@183",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@186",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@188",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@190",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@192"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p007",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "analogy",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "The ELIZA chatbot is used as an example of how primitive conversational systems were 50 to 60 years ago, because its conversation quickly goes nowhere.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@232",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@235",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@237",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@240",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@282",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@285",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@287",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@298",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@300",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@303",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@305",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@309"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p008",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "analogy",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "ChatGPT is contrasted with ELIZA as an example of a modern large language model that gives useful, to-the-point answers and relevant resources.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@311",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@314",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@317",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@319",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@331",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@334",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@336",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@340",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@343",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@346"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p009",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "We are living at a stage where research in natural language processing has made large language models such as GPT very powerful and sophisticated.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@349",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@351",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@354",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@356",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@359",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@363",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@367",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@370"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p010",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 1,
        "text": "If a learner is not familiar with ChatGPT, that is fine because the playlist will build its own GPT and explain it along the way.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@370",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@372",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@373",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@376",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@379"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p011",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "definition",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "An open-source model is one whose architecture is available to the public so that anyone can see it.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@405",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@407",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@409",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@412",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@414"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p012",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "definition",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "A closed-source model is one for which the weights, architecture, and other details are not released publicly.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@417",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@420",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@422",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@425",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@428"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p013",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "The gap between open-source and closed-source large language models is decreasing, and Llama 3.1 performs at the same level as GPT-4 in the lecturer's shown comparison.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@451",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@454",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@456",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@459",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@461",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@465"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p014",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "The information needed to learn is available now through open-source models.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@465",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@467",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@469",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@472",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@474"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p015",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "definition",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "Generative AI is broader than large language models and includes language, video, audio, and 3D models.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@493",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@495",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@497",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@500",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@503",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@506"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p016",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "Some highly realistic videos can be generated entirely by artificial intelligence rather than being shot on a camera.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@511",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@514",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@516",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@519",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@522",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@524",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@527",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@530"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p017",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "code",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "The lecturer shows an application in which selecting an MCQ generator, entering a topic such as gravity, and clicking generate causes a large language model to produce multiple-choice questions within seconds.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@539",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@542",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@546",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@549",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@552",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@555",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@558",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@560",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@562",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@564",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@566"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p018",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "Large language models and generative AI are changing many things around us, including education applications for teachers.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@568",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@571",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@573",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@576",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@578",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@580"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p019",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "The global generative AI job market is projected to grow about five to six times in the next five years.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@585",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@587",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@590",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@593",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@595",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@597"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p020",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 2,
        "text": "Large language models and generative AI are extremely useful skills whose demand will continue to increase in the future.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@597",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@600",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@603",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@606"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw:p021",
        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "Many existing courses focus on building LLM applications or giving quick overviews rather than teaching how to build a large language model from scratch.",
        "line_ids": [
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@624",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@626",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@628",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@629",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@632",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@633",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@638",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@640",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@642",
          "Xpr8D6LeAtw@644",
