        "video_id": "Xpr8D6LeAtw",
        "lecture": 1,
        "kind": "claim",
        "importance": 3,
        "text": "A key goal of learning to build an LLM from scratch is to be confident in interviews and able to answer detailed questions about topics like key, query, value, positional embedding, and positional encoding.",
